                </div>
                <div class='experience__tabs_content'>
                    <div class='experience__tabs_panel' data-panel='pe-mission'>
                        <div class='experience__tabs_inner'>
                            <p>To help women reconnect with themselves through
                                rituals of care and presence.</p>
                            <p>
                                Project Essence is a place where a woman
                                remembers she is her own most important project.
                                Every detail of our service is designed not just
                                to beautify, but to realign, soothe, and bring
                                her back to her essence.

                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class='experience__tabs_panel' data-panel='pe-vision'>
                        <div class='experience__tabs_inner'>
                            <p>
                                To become a leading boutique care destination in
                                Toronto, known for redefining beauty services
                                through mindful, aesthetic, and personalized
                                experiences — where each space embodies a state
                                of being.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class='experience__tabs_panel' data-panel='pe-values'>
                        <div class='experience__tabs_inner'>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Care > Service: We don't just serve, we
                                    care. Deeply.</li>
                                <li>Essence > Appearance: Beauty is rooted in
                                    inner calm and presence.</li>
                                <li>Consistency in Quality: From cuticle work to
                                    client communication.</li>
                                <li>Atmosphere Matters: Silence, light, scent,
                                    temperature — all are part of the ritual.</li>
                                <li>Client-Centered Thinking: We see through the
                                    eyes of the client.</li>
                                <li>Balance and Soft Power: No noise, just
                                    presence.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

