    <div class='experience__text'>
        <p>
            With two distinct locations, Earth (Ossington) and Air (Dupont) - we
            invite you to enter a space that mirrors your inner state and helps
            you return to it. Through expert techniques and mindful hospitality,
            we care not only for how you look, but how you feel.
        </p>
        <p>
            We offer not just aesthetic services, but curated rituals that
            return women to their inner balance. At Project Essence, care begins
            long before the manicure starts. Each appointment is an invitation
            to pause, breathe, and come back to yourself. We combine Eastern
            European technique, intentional interiors, and emotionally
            intelligent service in a way no other salon does.
        </p>
